<title>USA: IRT Property chairman cuts back duties.</title>
<headline>IRT Property chairman cuts back duties.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>IRT Property Co said Friday its chairman, Donald MacLeod, had resigned as a full-time employee effective June 30 but would remain chairman, a director and a consultant for the company.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that MaLeod's resignation is part of a long-time succession plan. Details of the succession plan were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
